WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.885
Suppose a model learned two simple tasks in-context,

00:00:03.965 --> 00:00:07.468
capitalizing certain words and swapping others.

00:00:07.548 --> 00:00:11.662
Given an input needing both, can it combine the skills?

00:00:11.742 --> 00:00:16.770
For humans this is trivial, yet even GPT-4 and
Claude 3 often fail.
